orCode.ORDER_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No order with id '$orderId'\",\n            )\n\n    @GetMapping\n    fun list(): List<Order> = repository.findAll()\n}\n","numLines":47,"startLine":1,"totalLines":47}}}
