rtions, and jsonPath checks.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All ticket requirements are implemented with tests.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint for shipment confirmation with idempotent retry support, rejecting cancelled and non-existent shipments appropriately.\nChanged       ApiError.kt: added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code for 409 Conflict when confirming cancelled shipments\n              ShipmentController.kt: added confirm() endpoint that transitions CREATED to CONFIRMED, handles idempotent retries on CONFIRMED, rejects CANCELLED with 409, and non-existent with 404\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: added four test cases covering CREATED→CONFIRMED transition, idempotent retry on CONFIRMED, 409 conflict on CANCELLED, and 404 on non-existent\nTests         \"confirms a CREATED shipment to CONFIRMED\": verifies status transition and persistence\n              \"confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds idempotently\": verifies retry idempotence\n              \"rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409\": verifies conflict response\n              \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404\": verifies not-found response\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test from sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run (5 existing + 4 new shipment tests + 4 order + 1 app + 3 customer), all passed, 0 failures, 0 errors\nNot done      Nothing — all acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests passing, no forbidden file changes.","ttft_ms":1900,"type":"result","duration_ms":97548,"uuid":"7db0ec4d-7eb9-432c-859c-fa908b378b7e","ttft_stream_ms":543,"time_to_request_ms":26,"first_content_frame_ms":543,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

